  "description": "In 1940, amidst an era of chaos, a beautiful mansion named Yeongchunhwa was built on a remote island, constructed solely out of a man's deep love for his wife. Time passed, and the story of the couple tied to the mansion faded from memory. Yet one day, a mysterious ‘caretaker’ appeared, transforming it into a lodging establishment. He began inviting people to the mansion—those who must love, guided by the couple's spirits...! \n\n *“Welcome to Yeongchunhwa, the secret mansion that will bring you infinite imagination. Here, any form of love is possible. Love and indulge freely. As long as the mansion permits.”* \n\nA luxurious mansion and the people who visit it for various reasons. Erotic stories for women, crafted by various authors, unfold now. \n\n**Second Short Story *Non-Slip Nerd Fantasy (NNF):*** Kim Do-Rim, a successful career woman in her 30s, and Oh Yeon-Tae, an aspiring mystery novelist. Do-Rim, constantly chased by her career, harbored a desire for deep sleep. Yeon-Tae, having lived isolated from others for years as an aspiring writer, harbored a desire to overcome the limitations of his creativity. These two individuals, whose lives have been completely opposite with no overlap whatsoever, receive an invitation from Youngchunhwa and travel to the mansion. Inside, they discover a Fantasy Booth that promises to fulfill their desires...?\n\n *“Did we... really do it in the Fantasy Booth...?”*\n\nCan the two truly blossom their desires within the mansion?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
